flowchart TB
    Start([User opens browser]) --> Login[Login page]
    Login --> Auth{Valid credentials?}
    Auth -->|No| Login
    Auth -->|Yes| Role{User role?}

    Role -->|SuperAdmin Admin| Dashboard[Dashboard Analytics]
    Role -->|Doctor Staff| Patients[Patient list]

    Dashboard --> Modules[Clinic modules]
    Patients --> Modules

    Modules --> M1[Manage Patients]
    Modules --> M2[Manage Doctors and Staff]
    Modules --> M3[Manage Appointments]
    Modules --> M4[Financials Billing]
    Modules --> M5[Prescriptions]
    Modules --> M6[Gummy Smile Analysis]
    Modules --> M7[X-Ray Analysis]
    Modules --> M8[Admin Management]

    M6 --> AI1[External Gummy Smile API]
    M7 --> AI2[External X-Ray Analysis API]

    M1 --> DB[(SQL Server)]
    M2 --> DB
    M3 --> DB
    M4 --> DB
    M5 --> DB
    M6 --> DB
    M7 --> DB
    M8 --> DB

    DB --> End([Data saved and displayed])
